{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a tiny pixel city that grows by itself. Place buildings to increase your brick production, unlock new structures, and watch your miniature world bustle with people, cars, and buses as it expands. It\u2019s a calm, incremental city builder where your town keeps working even when you take a break.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Incremental Gameplay</strong><br>Place buildings and watch your brick production climb as your city becomes more efficient.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951870/extras/0fd92f535ee7de3d69a3d579c047c096.poster.avif?t=1769058604\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951870/extras/0fd92f535ee7de3d69a3d579c047c096.webm?t=1769058604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951870/extras/0fd92f535ee7de3d69a3d579c047c096.mp4?t=1769058604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy Pixel City</strong><br>Tiny people wander the streets, vehicles pass by, and the world comes to life as you expand.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951870/extras/f782c8a9ad4e3f9a89abfc61419efebd.poster.avif?t=1769058604\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951870/extras/f782c8a9ad4e3f9a89abfc61419efebd.webm?t=1769058604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951870/extras/f782c8a9ad4e3f9a89abfc61419efebd.mp4?t=1769058604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Click or Idle \u2014 Your Choice</strong><br>Click to boost early progress, or simply let your buildings generate resources over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; Expand</strong><br>Unlock stronger buildings, production boosters, and late-game structures to push your city further.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951870/extras/b9543979195930fa50a7a960d6062c71.poster.avif?t=1769058604\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951870/extras/b9543979195930fa50a7a960d6062c71.webm?t=1769058604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951870/extras/b9543979195930fa50a7a960d6062c71.mp4?t=1769058604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prestige &amp; Rebuild</strong><br>Complete your Monument to restart with a permanent global bonus, making each new run faster and more rewarding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stress-Free City Building</strong><br>No losing, no timers, no pressure \u2014 just steady progress and a satisfying growth curve.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3951870?t=1769058604","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3951870?t=1769058604","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.s